ng I call The Clot. May I?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, certainly! I think this was really the intention, among other things, of this thread. I do not particularly care about being creditted, but would love to hear what you or your players end up doing with him. Please do keep me informed over PM or something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T17:16:15-08:00","id":802470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/798547-alpha-predators-the-strongest-vampires?p=800525#post800525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, oh, oh, I got one.<br /> <br /> \u014cgimi is a character for the Tokyo setting from Requiem 2e. The writeup here also features a new bloodline. Because why not.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tWP0ZBeN8PhUnV-1ODDHeWtXW75IxyZx15_CaIVgdh8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a></div> </div> </div> </div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Striking Looks (Advanced) 2???</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user